- Frequency limits where practical.
- Account-specific hidden ads.
- Deduplication and exclusion of ineligible campaigns.

Avoid a ranking system that systematically excludes new or smaller sellers.

Do not invent buyer interests or collect unnecessary personal data. Provide reasonable fallbacks when interest data is unavailable.

