## 17. FINAL ACCEPTANCE CRITERIA

Do not declare SokoTZ production-ready until evidence confirms that:

- A normal user cannot grant themselves a privileged role.
- A seller cannot modify another seller's campaigns.
- A client cannot mark a payment verified.
- An unverified payment cannot activate a campaign.
